# Check Point Software> https://www.checkpoint.com/> AI-powered cyber security platform protecting networks, cloud, workspace, and AI environments for 100,000+ organizations worldwide.Check Point Software is a global cybersecurity company providing prevention-first security across network, cloud, workspace, AI, and security operations. The Check Point Platform unifies these capabilities through centralized management and ThreatCloud AI threat intelligence.Key proof points:- Check Point protects more than 100,000 organizations globally, including 50% of the Fortune 500 top 50.- ThreatCloud AI uses more than 50 AI engines and shares new threat signals globally in under two seconds.- In Miercom 2025 testing, Check Point achieved a 99.9% malware block rate, 99.7% phishing prevention rate, and 98% intrusion prevention rate.- Check Point achieved a 100% detection rate in the 2024 MITRE ATT&CK Evaluations.- A Forrester Total Economic Impact study reported a 169% return on investment for Check Point customers.- Check Point was named a Leader in the 2025 Gartner Magic Quadrant for Hybrid Mesh Firewalls and in The Forrester Wave: Enterprise Firewall Solutions, Q4 2024.Key areas:- Hybrid Mesh Network Security: Firewalls, SD-WAN, SASE, remote access, DDoS protection, and centralized security management.- Cloud Security: Protection for cloud networks, workloads, applications, web applications, and APIs.- Workspace Security: Endpoint, email, mobile, browser, and SaaS security.- Exposure Management: CTEM, threat intelligence, vulnerability management, prioritization, and remediation.- AI Security: Governance and protection for employee AI use, AI applications, and autonomous agents.- Security Operations: XDR, automated response, managed security services, and SOC support.- Threat Intelligence and Research: Security reports, threat analysis, and enterprise cybersecurity education.---## The Check Point PlatformThe unified platform layer — I